  "translation": "Dawid ye ⟨את⟩ Israyɛl ɲɛmɔgɔw bɛɛ lajɛ: kablaw ɲɛmɔgɔw, ani dangaw ɲɛmɔgɔw minnu bɛ masakɛ sɔn, ani wulumaɲa ɲɛmɔgɔw ani kɛmɛ ɲɛmɔgɔw, ani bɛɛ ɲɛmɔgɔw minnu bɛ masakɛ ni a denw ka dɔw ni misi ɲɛjinɛ kan, ni sirisikɛlaw, ani jagotigiw, ani bɛɛ jagotigi min bɛ ja bon — ka bɔ ka na Yerushalayim (Jerusalɛmu).",
